@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ito-il29-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il29-time`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Income Tax Ordinance s 1, "תושב ישראל" (b): an Israeli resident, for a body of persons ("חבר בני אדם"),
-- with the exception for control and management exercised in Israel by a first-time resident or a
-- veteran returning resident (s 14(a)), and s 14(b)(2)(b), which counts the adjustment year in his ten
-- years.  Row IL-29.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Section 1 "Israeli resident" (b)`

-- src:ITO:124 | ”חבר בני אדם“ – כל גוף ציבורי, מואגד או מאוחד, וכל חברה, אגודת אחים, חברותה או התאחדות, בין שהן מואגדות ובין שאינן מואגדות;
-- src:ITO:164 | (ב) לגבי חבר בני אדם – חבר בני אדם שהתקיים בו אחד מאלה:
-- src:ITO:165 | (1) הוא התאגד בישראל;
-- src:ITO:166 | (2) השליטה על עסקיו וניהולם מופעלים בישראל למעט חבר בני אדם שהשליטה על עסקיו וניהולם כאמור מופעלים בישראל בידי יחיד שהיה לתושב ישראל לראשונה או שהיה לתושב חוזר ותיק, כאמור בסעיף 14(א), וטרם חלפו עשר שנים מהמועד שהיה לתושב ישראל כאמור, או בידי מי מטעמו, ובלבד שאותו חבר בני אדם לא היה תושב ישראל גם אם השליטה על עסקיו וניהולם לא היו מופעלים בידי יחיד כאמור או בידי מי מטעמו, אלא אם כן חבר בני האדם ביקש אחרת;

@ref ITO s 1, "תושב ישראל" (b)(2), line 166: the day the exception's individual became resident was not given
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the exception in paragraph (b)(2) turns on the days that individual arrived and became an Israeli resident, and they were not given` MEANS
    REFUSE "the exception in paragraph (b)(2) turns on the days that individual arrived in Israel and became an Israeli resident, and they were not given"

-- The day the ten years run from.  s 14(b)(2)(b), line 1144: if he elected the adjustment year, it counts in
-- the ten years of (b)(2), so they run from the day he arrived; otherwise from the day he became a resident.
-- src:ITO:1141 | (ב)(1) על אף האמור בפסקה (א) להגדרה ”תושב ישראל“ או ”תושב“, לא יראו יחיד שהיה לתושב ישראל לראשונה או לתושב חוזר ותיק, כתושב ישראל, במשך שנה אחת מהמועד שבו עלה או שב לישראל, לפי העניין (בסעיף קטן זה – שנת ההסתגלות), ובלבד שהיחיד הודיע, בתוך 90 ימים מיום הגעתו לישראל כאמור, בטופס שקבע המנהל, על בחירתו בהחלת הוראות סעיף קטן זה.
-- src:ITO:1143 | (א) תקופת הפטור האמורה בסעיף קטן (א);
-- src:ITO:1144 | (ב) התקופה האמורה בפסקה (ב)(2) להגדרה ”תושב ישראל“ או ”תושב“;

@ref ITO s 14(b)(2)(b), lines 1143-1144; s 1 (b)(2), line 166
GIVEN b IS A `A body of persons in a tax year`
GIVETH A DATE
`the day the ten years of paragraph (b)(2) run from, for` b MEANS
    IF   b's `that individual elected the adjustment year of section 14(b)`
    THEN CONSIDER b's `the day that individual arrived in Israel`
         WHEN JUST d THEN d
         WHEN NOTHING THEN `the exception in paragraph (b)(2) turns on the days that individual arrived and became an Israeli resident, and they were not given`
    ELSE CONSIDER b's `the day that individual became an Israeli resident`
         WHEN JUST d THEN d
         WHEN NOTHING THEN `the exception in paragraph (b)(2) turns on the days that individual arrived and became an Israeli resident, and they were not given`

-- The values of "the exception disapplies limb (2) for the tax year", on the readings allowed.
@ref ITO s 1, "תושב ישראל" (b)(2), line 166
GIVEN b IS A `A body of persons in a tax year`
      r IS A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
GIVETH A LIST OF BOOLEAN
`the exception in paragraph (b)(2) disapplies limb (2), on the readings allowed, for` b `under` r MEANS
    IF   NOT b's `the control and management in Israel were exercised by an individual who became a first-time resident or a veteran returning resident, or by someone on his behalf`
         OR NOT b's `it would not have been an Israeli resident had the control and management not been exercised in Israel by such an individual or on his behalf`
         OR b's `the body of persons asked otherwise`
    THEN LIST FALSE
    ELSE map (GIVEN m YIELD m)
             (`the possible matches of the window from` (`the day the ten years of paragraph (b)(2) run from, for` b)
                 `to` (`the last day of the window of` 10 `years from` (`the day the ten years of paragraph (b)(2) run from, for` b))
                 `, counted as` (JUST 10) `, with` (b's `the tax year`) `under` (r's `windows`))

-- The values of "control and management were exercised in Israel", on the readings allowed.
@ref ITO s 1, "תושב ישראל" (b)(2), line 166: fork PY (a connection for part of the tax year)
GIVEN b IS A `A body of persons in a tax year`
      r IS A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
GIVETH A LIST OF BOOLEAN
`control and management were exercised in Israel, on the readings allowed, for` b `under` r MEANS
    CONSIDER b's `the control and management of its business were exercised in Israel`
    WHEN `throughout the tax year` THEN LIST TRUE
    WHEN `not at all in the tax year` THEN LIST FALSE
    WHEN `for part of the tax year` THEN
        CONSIDER r's `part-year connection`
        WHEN `declined where the readings differ` THEN LIST TRUE, FALSE
        WHEN `a connection for any part of the tax year is the connection` THEN LIST TRUE
        WHEN `only a connection throughout the tax year is the connection` THEN LIST FALSE

@ref ITO s 1, "תושב ישראל" (b)(2): the readings differ
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`the body of persons may or may not be an Israeli resident, depending on how a connection for part of the tax year, or the ten years of the exception, are matched with the tax year` MEANS
    REFUSE "the body of persons may or may not be an Israeli resident: the text does not say whether control and management in Israel for only part of the tax year, or the ten years of the exception that end inside it, make it one"

@export Whether a body of persons was an Israeli resident in a tax year from 2024 under Income Tax Ordinance s 1 "Israeli resident" (b): incorporated in Israel, or control and management of its business exercised in Israel (except where exercised by a first-time or veteran returning resident within ten years, on the conditions of the paragraph); each fork of the text declines by default
@ref ITO s 1, "תושב ישראל" (b), lines 164-166; s 14(b)(2)(b), lines 1143-1144
GIVEN b IS A `A body of persons in a tax year`
          @desc the tax year, whether it was incorporated in Israel, for how long control and management were exercised in Israel, and the facts of the exception
      r IS A `The readings of the forks of row IL-29`
          @desc the reading of each fork
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 1 "Israeli resident" (b): a body of persons is an Israeli resident in the tax year of` b `under` r MEANS
    `for` (b's `the tax year`) `, row IL-29 answers`
        (IF   b's `it was incorporated in Israel`
         THEN TRUE
         ELSE `the single value among` `all values` `, else` `the body of persons may or may not be an Israeli resident, depending on how a connection for part of the tax year, or the ten years of the exception, are matched with the tax year`)
    WHERE
        `control values`   MEANS `control and management were exercised in Israel, on the readings allowed, for` b `under` r
        `exception values` MEANS
            IF   all (GIVEN c YIELD NOT c) `control values`
            THEN LIST FALSE
            ELSE `the exception in paragraph (b)(2) disapplies limb (2), on the readings allowed, for` b `under` r
        `all values` MEANS
            concat (map (GIVEN c YIELD map (GIVEN x YIELD c AND NOT x) `exception values`) `control values`)
